    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1750080/extras/b64915021b6243364cdee2f87152d573.poster.avif?t=1743362080\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1750080/extras/b64915021b6243364cdee2f87152d573.webm?t=1743362080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1750080/extras/b64915021b6243364cdee2f87152d573.mp4?t=1743362080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>A shaggy lonely dog goes on a journey. Along the way, he tries to decide what his way is: a wild animal\u2019s or a pet\u2019s one. Despite the cruelty of this world, the dog is still able to dream vividly.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1750080/extras/c16b3f142631951aaf9a1abc46b5ba37.poster.avif?t=1743362080\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1750080/extras/c16b3f142631951aaf9a1abc46b5ba37.webm?t=1743362080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1750080/extras/c16b3f142631951aaf9a1abc46b5ba37.mp4?t=1743362080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Paper Bum</strong> is a dark and atmospheric adventure in a drawn world with difficult moral choices and a stringy soundtrack.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1750080/extras/7a0dcd6c148ee649125d7859d9afed0a.poster.avif?t=1743362080\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1750080/extras/7a0dcd6c148ee649125d7859d9afed0a.webm?t=1743362080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1750080/extras/7a0dcd6c148ee649125d7859d9afed0a.mp4?t=1743362080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1750080/extras/cce6bb21850299bad52bd82bf0ded65e.avif?t=1743362080\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1750080/extras/075dae7b802d526d0a6e67ae94c2f7e3.webp?t=1743362080\" /></div> Help the dog to survive in a world where he\u2019s not welcome.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1750080/extras/075dae7b802d526d0a6e67ae94c2f7e3.webp?t=1743362080\" /></div> Lead the dog through the realm of vivid dreams.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1750080/extras/075dae7b802d526d0a6e67ae94c2f7e3.webp?t=1743362080\" /></div> Make a difficult moral choice: do people deserve forgiveness?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1750080/extras/075dae7b802d526d0a6e67ae94c2f7e3.webp?t=1743362080\" /></div> Immerse yourself in the dog\u2019s world of associations and smells<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1750080/extras/7884fccb2266cf8fd191bd323a7a007e.poster.avif?t=1743362080\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1750080/extras/7884fccb2266cf8fd191bd323a7a007e.webm?t=1743362080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1750080/extras/7884fccb2266cf8fd191bd323a7a007e.mp4?t=1743362080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
